// Interactive test story
[[chapter: start]: [text: A Simple Choice]],

[[as:]: [text:
You stand at a crossroads. One path leads left, one leads right.
]],

[[display: [text: Which way do you go?]]:
	[[option: [text: Go Left]]: [goto: [section: left]]],
	[[option: [text: Go Right]]: [goto: [section: right]]]
],

[section: left],
[[as:]: [text:
You venture left and find a peaceful forest with tall trees.
You have found an exit!
]],

[[display: [text: Return to the start?]]:
	[[option: [text: Yes]]: [goto: [section: start]]],
	[[option: [text: No]]: [goto: [section: ending]]]
],

[section: right],
[[as:]: [text:
You venture right and find yourself in a mysterious cave.
Deep in the cave, you discover treasure!
]],

[[display: [text: Keep exploring or leave?]]:
	[[option: [text: Keep exploring]]: [goto: [section: deeper]]],
	[[option: [text: Leave]]: [goto: [section: ending]]]
],

[section: deeper],
[[as:]: [text:
Deep in the cave, you find an ancient map leading to lost civilizations.
]],

[[display: [text: What do you do with the map?]]:
	[[option: [text: Keep it]]: [goto: [section: ending]]],
	[[option: [text: Leave it]]: [goto: [section: ending]]]
],

[section: start],
[[as:]: [text:
You find yourself back at the crossroads again. Ready for another adventure?
]],

[[display: [text: Choose your path:]]:
	[[option: [text: Left]]: [goto: [section: left]]],
	[[option: [text: Right]]: [goto: [section: right]]]
],

[section: ending],
[[as:]: [text:
You leave the crossroads behind, taking your memories with you.
Thus ends your adventure.
]]
